---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { CALENDLY_URL } from '../consts';
---
<Layout title="Implementation · LatentSig" description="AI implementation engineering shaped around practical requirements, evaluation, and delivery.">
  <section class="impl-hero"><div class="impl-wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">IMPLEMENTATION ENGINEERING</p><h1>Practical <em>AI Engineering.</em></h1><p>We help teams move from an AI idea or prototype toward an engineered solution, with scope and delivery shaped around the problem at hand.</p><a href={`${CALENDLY_URL}?utm_source=latentsig_website&utm_campaign=implementation`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discuss an implementation ↗</a></div><ol><li><b>01 · Scope</b><span>Clarify requirements, constraints, and success criteria.</span></li><li><b>02 · Build</b><span>Implement the agreed architecture and workflow.</span></li><li><b>03 · Evaluate</b><span>Review behavior and define the next iteration.</span></li></ol></div></section>
  <section class="impl-pillar"><div class="impl-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">ENGINEERING PRACTICE</p><h2>Make the decisions visible.</h2><div class="impl-cards"><article><b>Evaluation</b><p>Agree what useful behavior looks like and how it will be reviewed.</p></article><article><b>System design</b><p>Choose components and boundaries that fit the task and constraints.</p></article><article><b>Iteration</b><p>Build in review points so teams can learn from working software.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="impl-cta"><h2>Bring us the implementation challenge.</h2><p>We can discuss the context, the risks, and a useful way to explore the next step.</p><a href="/contact/">Contact LatentSig</a></section>
</Layout>
<style>
  .impl-hero,.impl-pillar,.impl-cta{padding:88px 24px;background:#0b1020;color:#f4f2ff;font-family:Geist,system-ui,sans-serif}.impl-hero{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 0,#3e377455,transparent 50%),#0b1020}.impl-wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:auto}.impl-hero .impl-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}.eyebrow{color:#c0c1ff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.15em}.impl-hero h1{font:600 clamp(2.8rem,5.5vw,5rem)/1.02 'Hanken Grotesk',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.04em}.impl-hero h1 em{color:#c0c1ff;font-style:normal}.impl-hero p:not(.eyebrow),.impl-cta p{color:#bcbacf;line-height:1.7;font-size:16px}.impl-hero a,.impl-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:48px;padding:0 17px;margin-top:18px;border-radius:7px;background:#c0c1ff;color:#17142f;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:14px}.impl-hero ol{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:25px;border:1px solid #393d54;border-radius:12px;background:#11182a}.impl-hero li{padding:17px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #373b4e}.impl-hero li:last-child{border:0}.impl-hero li b,.impl-hero li span{display:block}.impl-hero li span{margin-top:7px;color:#afadc1;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5}.impl-pillar{background:#080c18;border-block:1px solid #24293b}.impl-pillar h2,.impl-cta h2{font:600 clamp(2rem,3.5vw,3.2rem)/1.1 'Hanken Grotesk',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em}.impl-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}.impl-cards article{padding:22px;border:1px solid #393d54;border-radius:10px;background:#101629}.impl-cards b{font:600 18px 'Hanken Grotesk',sans-serif}.impl-cards p{color:#afadc1;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6}.impl-cta{padding-top:68px;padding-bottom:68px}.impl-cta h2{max-width:750px}.impl-cta p{max-width:700px}@media(max-width:760px){.impl-hero,.impl-pillar,.impl-cta{padding:58px 18px}.impl-hero .impl-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}.impl-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
